    "sections": {
        "description": "SKT Plastic Surgery is a clean, modern, and fully responsive WordPress theme designed for plastic surgery clinics, cosmetic surgeons, dermatology practices, and medical spas. It offers essential customization options like custom logo, header, menus, footer widgets, and theme settings via the Customizer. The theme is translation-ready with RTL support and fully compatible with WooCommerce. It works seamlessly with Gutenberg, Elementor, and other popular page builders for flexible and intuitive design. Built using ITCSS and BEM methodology, it ensures fast performance, clean code, SEO-friendliness, and compatibility with popular WordPress plugins. Documentation: https://www.sktthemesdemo.net/documentation/skt-skincare-doc/"
    },
